%N A398430 a(n) is the smallest m that is divisible by Sum_{i=1..n} (m mod prime(i)).
%H A398430 Rémy Sigrist, <a href="/A398430/b398430.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..7500</a> (first 300 terms from Michel Marcus)
%H A398430 Rémy Sigrist, <a href="/A398430/a398430.txt">C++ program</a>
%F A398430 a(n) <= A070826(n). - _Rémy Sigrist_, Jul 29 2026
%o A398430 (PARI) a(n) = my(m=1, vp=primes(n)); while (m % vecsum(vector(#vp, i, m % vp[i])), m++); m;
